# Line endings for the helper scripts (pomocnik/): Windows launchers keep CRLF (+ UTF-8 BOM in .ps1) byte for byte,
# shell/Python scripts must have LF or they fail on macOS/Linux ("bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M").
*.cmd      -text
*.ps1      -text
*.command  text eol=lf
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.py       text eol=lf
*.md       text eol=lf
*.txt      text eol=lf
